</head><body><div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 39 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">下學期總複習</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">L21-L38 重點回顧 · Trap大挑戰 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心目標：</b>🪤 重溫下學期 18 堂所有核心知識 + 終極Trap挑戰！<br/>
<b>涵蓋範圍：</b>乘除進階、四則混合、Fraction、Decimal、圖表、容量、時間、3D Solid、數感、方向、Symmetry、可能性<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 系統重溫 ❷ Trap識別 ❸ 弱項檢測 ❹ 信心建立<br/>
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維》3下全冊
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、P3 下學期知識地圖</div>
<div class="check-grid">
<div style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">L21 Multiplication進階<br/>進位要加返！</div>
<div style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">L22 Division進階<br/>餘數 &lt; 除數！</div>
<div style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">L23 Division應用<br/>加1定唔加？</div>
<div style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">L24 四則混合<br/>先乘除後加減！</div>
<div style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">L25 Fraction進階<br/>分母唔會加！</div>
<div style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">L26 Fraction應用<br/>分母≠整體！</div>
<div style="background:#F3E8FF;color:#7C3AED;">L27 Decimal初探<br/>0.1=<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span></div>
<div style="background:#F3E8FF;color:#7C3AED;">L28/L29 棒形圖<br/>一格=幾多？</div>
<div style="background:#FCE7F3;color:#9D174D;">L30 綜合應用<br/>測量+記錄+圖表</div>
<div style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">L31 容量進階<br/>1L=1000mL！</div>
<div style="background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;">L32 時間進階<br/>1.5h≠1h50m！</div>
<div style="background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;">L33 時間應用<br/>搭車時間要加！</div>
<div style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">L34 3D Solid圖形<br/>Circle柱≠Circle錐！</div>
<div style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">L35 數感進階<br/>Estimation≠亂估！</div>
<div style="background:#F3E8FF;color:#7C3AED;">L36 方向和位置<br/>左右≠東西！</div>
<div style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">L37 Symmetry初探<br/>Symmetry軸可多於1條</div>
<div style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">L38 可能性<br/>「可能」≠「一定」</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h1">二、終極Trap挑戰（共 10 題 — 每題都係經典Trap！）<span class="star">🪤</span></div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🎯 總複習·陷阱獵人</div><div class="lf-game-desc">綜合複習挑戰！涵蓋本學期所有陷阱類型。連續答對5題解鎖「陷阱大師」稱號！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔥 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">來源</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>🪤 156 x 4 = ？小心進位！（L21Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L21</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>🪤 59 ÷ 7 = ？餘數係咪 &lt; 7？（L22Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L22</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>🪤 38 粒糖，每 5 粒一盒。要全部裝晒，要幾多盒？（L23Trap：加1！）</td><td class="qd sh">L23</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>🪤 5 + 3 x 6 = ？A. 48 B. 23 C. 33（L24Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L24</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>🪤 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> = ？A. <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">14</span></span> B. <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> C. <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>（L25Trap：分母唔加！）</td><td class="qd sh">L25</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>🪤 1.5 小時 = ？（L32Trap：P3 最大Trap！）</td><td class="qd sh">L32</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>🪤 Circle柱和Circle錐有咩分別？（L34Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L34</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>🪤 Square有幾多條Symmetry軸？Rectangle呢？（L37Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L37</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>🪤 一格=2嘅棒形圖，棒高5格=幾多？（L28Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L28</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>🪤 盒裡有 9 紅 1 藍。閉眼抽一粒。抽到紅色係「一定」定「可能」？（L38Trap）</td><td class="qd sh">L38</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、核心課題混合練習</div>
<div class="lf-h2">A. 數與運算（L21-L24）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>267 x 3 = ？（直式，注意進位）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>76 ÷ 5 = ？（有餘數，驗證）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>43 人去旅行，每架車坐 6 人。最少要幾多架車？（加1？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>48 - 6 x 5 + 12 ÷ 3 = ？（四則次序！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">B. Fraction與Decimal（L25-L27）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？（假Fraction→帶Fraction）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>24 個學生嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = 幾多人？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>0.7 = <span class="f"><span class="n">?</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">?</span></span>     <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span> = ?.? </td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>0.8 + 0.5 = ？1.6 - 0.9 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">C. 度量、圖形與數據（L28-L37）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>2.5 L = ＿＿ mL（L31）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>8:30 + 2 小時 45 min = ＿＿：＿＿（L33）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>長方體有＿＿個面、＿＿條棱、＿＿個頂點。（L34）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>學校在公園的北面。公園在學校的＿＿面。（L36）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>等邊Triangle有幾多條Symmetry軸？Square呢？（L37）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>擲一粒骰仔，擲到「7」。呢個係：一定/可能/不可能？（L38）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）綜合挑戰<span class="star">🎯</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>📦 一箱有 168 個橙，超市訂了 5 箱。共有多少個橙？如果每個橙賣 $3，總共賣到幾多錢？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🍕 一個 Pizza 切 8 件。小明吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，妹妹吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。共吃了幾分之幾？剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>⏰ 電影 14:15 開始，片長 2 小時 20 min。幾點完？如果之後要用 25 min搭車返屋企，幾點返到？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>🥤 一支汽水 1.5 L。倒了 3 杯，每杯 200 mL。還剩多少 L？多少 mL？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>🔍 麵包店每日賣出數量（一格=5個）：星期一 4格、二 6格、三 3格、四 7格、五 8格。<br/>(a) 星期幾賣最多？(b) 五日共賣多少個？(c) 平均每日賣多少個？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、終極Trap複習卡</div>
<div class="trap-grid">
<div class="lf-trap-card"><div class="trap-title">🪤 Trap1：進位要加返</div><div class="trap-info">L21：156x4 → 每步乘完要加返進位數字！</div></div>
<div class="trap-card fixed"><div class="trap-title">✅ 解藥：螢光筆圈進位</div><div class="trap-info">用螢光筆圈住進位數字，提醒自己加返！</div></div>
<div class="lf-trap-card"><div class="trap-title">🪤 Trap2：餘數 ≥ 除數</div><div class="trap-info">L22：85÷6=13...7（錯！7&gt;6，仲可以除！）</div></div>
<div class="trap-card fixed"><div class="trap-title">✅ 解藥：驗證法</div><div class="trap-info">除數x商+餘數=被除數，餘數&lt;除數</div></div>
<div class="lf-trap-card"><div class="trap-title">🪤 Trap3：分母相加</div><div class="trap-info">L25：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>（錯！分母不變！）</div></div>
<div class="trap-card fixed"><div class="trap-title">✅ 解藥：分母不變</div><div class="trap-info">只有分子相加減，分母保持不變！</div></div>
<div class="lf-trap-card"><div class="trap-title">🪤 Trap4：1.5h=1h50m</div><div class="trap-info">L32：P3最大Trap！0.5x60=30min！</div></div>
<div class="trap-card fixed"><div class="trap-title">✅ 解藥：乘60</div><div class="trap-info">Decimal時間轉min → 乘60！</div></div>
<div class="lf-trap-card"><div class="trap-title">🪤 Trap5：先加減後乘除</div><div class="trap-info">L24：5+3x4=32（錯！應先乘：5+12=17）</div></div>
<div class="trap-card fixed"><div class="trap-title">✅ 解藥：VIP規則</div><div class="trap-info">括號→乘除→加減，同級由左到右</div></div>
<div class="lf-trap-card"><div class="trap-title">🪤 Trap6：可能=一定</div><div class="trap-info">L38：9紅1藍，抽到紅=可能（唔係一定！）</div></div>
<div class="trap-card fixed"><div class="trap-title">✅ 解藥：問自己</div><div class="trap-info">「有冇可能唔發生？」如有 → 只係「可能」</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 你已經學晒 P3 下學期全部 18 堂嘅重點！只要避開呢啲Trap，你就係數學高手！加油！💪🏆</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Homework — 自我檢測<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>列出你認為 P3 下學期最難嘅 3 個課題，並解釋點解覺得難。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>溫習 L21-L24：做 5 題混合四則計算題，自己出俾自己。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>溫習 L25-L27：Fraction加減 3 題 + Decimal轉換 3 題。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>溫習 L31-L33：容量轉換 2 題 + 時間計算 2 題。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>寫出你的「Trap筆記」：記錄你在本堂做錯的Question和Correct Approach。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>自製一張「P3 下學期Trap清單」，包含至少 10 個Trap和其解藥。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>模擬考試：自己出 10 題涵蓋所有課題，做完後自己批改。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>教導家長：用 5 min向爸爸/媽媽解釋「1.5小時點解等於1小時30min而唔係1小時50min」。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">七、自我評估表</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
